@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Review - Create Product Review

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Customer|
start
note right
Precondition:
The customer is signed in.

Postcondition:
The review is stored and the product's rating average
and review count are updated.
end note
:Open the review form of a bought product;
|System|
:Display the review form;
|Customer|
:Choose a rating from 1 to 5 and enter a comment;
:Submit the review;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Customer|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the product is listed, bought in a completed order and not reviewed yet;
if (The product is hidden, no completed order contains it, it is already reviewed or the data is invalid?) then (Yes)
  :Return the review error;
  |Customer|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Save the review and update the product rating;
|Customer|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
